  "description": "\\*\\*Original Webtoon:\\*\\* \\[Lezhin\\](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/genie), \\[Bomtoon\\](https://www.bomtoon.com/comic/ep\\_list/jiny/?p\\_id=tw2004), \\[Ridibooks\\](https://ridibooks.com/books/4419006180), \\[KakaoPage\\](https://page.kakao.com/content/63205937) Writer Lim Hyun-jung's comeback! Geun-future, which has become impossible to distinguish between artificial intelligence chatbots and humans. Jesse, a science and technology pessimist and naive romantic, is struggling to be recognized as a \"pure writer\" in the publishing market full of box office hits made by big data analysis. Roy, Jesse's boyfriend and CEO of the industry's No. 1 VR game producer, wants a logical and rational woman, and as the conflict between the two grows, Jesse comes with a mysterious wealth... What does Jesie have as an \"ideal man\" who has everything she wants?!",
